      "paragraphs": [
        "North America led the market in 2018, when it held a major share, according to the CMI report. The region's lead rested on the large number of key players based there. Asia Pacific is expected to be the fastest-growing region, the CMI report adds. Buyers looking at web scraping services market share by region should read those two facts together: the established base sits in North America, while the faster expansion is expected in Asia Pacific. Website owners are also tightening access to their pages. Cloudflare announced that from September 15, 2026, its default settings will block mixed-use crawlers from any pages that host ads, TechCrunch reported in June 2026. Meta removed a controversial web scraping clause from its commercial terms on October 17, 2026, after legal experts and the public pushed back, TechJuice reported that month. Tighter controls raise the cost of collection and favour providers that can work within the rules."
