    detail: The updates, unveiled at Envestnet's Elevate 2026 conference in Phoenix, expand AI automation and deepen integration with MoneyGuide to help advisors streamline workflows and deliver more personalized
- Envestnet unveiled AI-driven data automation and deeper MoneyGuide integration on its Wealth Management Platform at its Elevate 2026 conference. (source: Yahoo Finance, 2026-05)
    detail: The enhancements form part of Envestnet's R2 2026 release, showcased on the mainstage at the Phoenix Convention Center.
- Savvy Wealth, an AI-native wealth management platform for independent financial advisors, launched the Savvy Custodial Platform for RIA owners and firms working with its introducing broker-dealer business. (source: Yahoo Finance, 2026-09)
    detail: Founder and CEO Ritik Malhotra said the launch aims to remove everything standing between an advisor and serving their client, extending independence to every account.
