QUESTION 6 (Q9): What will the wealth management platform market look like in the next few years?
Facts this answer may use:
- Market forecast: USD 20.84 Bn (2033)
- Growth rate (CAGR): 15.2% (2026 to 2033)
- Growing adoption of robo advisory solutions presents a huge opportunity in the global wealth management platform market.
