- Apex Fintech Solutions formed an alliance with FusionIQ to combine Apex's clearing, custody and brokerage infrastructure with FusionIQ's cloud-based digital wealth platform. (source: Yahoo Finance, 2026-09)
    detail: The combined offering is intended to reduce integration complexity and shorten time-to-market for banks, credit unions, registered investment advisors and broker-dealers seeking to modernise their wea
- Broadridge Financial Solutions expanded its digital assets platform to U.S. wealth management firms, giving broker-dealers, RIAs and wealth managers a single environment for cryptocurrencies and tokenized securities alongside conventional investments. (source: InvestmentNews, 2026-09)
    detail: Broadridge said approximately 32% of financial advisors invested in crypto for client accounts in 2025, up from 22% previously.
- Panelists at RIA Edge Orange County said recent advisor surveys show 63% of RIAs are currently using AI, double the level in 2024, but only 1 in 10 firms uses it as a fully integrated part of their business strategy. (source: Wealth Management.com, 2026-10)
