- Singapore leads Southeast Asia in digital wealth adoption, with leading digital wealth platforms used each month by 9% of the country's internet users, nearly three times the share of the next-ranked market, Malaysia. (source: Fintech News Singapore, 2026-10)
    detail: The finding comes from the e-Conomy SEA 2026 report by Google, Temasek and Bain & Company.
- Modera Wealth Management, a New Jersey-based RIA overseeing $20 billion in assets, launched Mira, a proprietary agentic AI-powered operating platform built over two years with OnTrade. (source: Wealth Management, 2026-10)
