- Digital wealth management firm Farther raised $150 million in a Series D funding round led by General Atlantic to scale its intelligent wealth platform. (source: fintechfutures, 2026-05)
- Envestnet announced AI-powered enhancements and financial planning integrations for its Wealth Management Platform as part of its second technology release of 2026. (source: Pulse 2.0, 2026-05)
    detail: The updates, unveiled at Envestnet's Elevate 2026 conference in Phoenix, expand AI automation and deepen integration with MoneyGuide to help advisors streamline workflows and deliver more personalized
- Envestnet unveiled AI-driven data automation and deeper MoneyGuide integration on its Wealth Management Platform at its Elevate 2026 conference. (source: Yahoo Finance, 2026-05)
