      "sop": "country_us",
      "heading": "Which region leads the digital marketing software market?",
      "paragraphs": [
        "North America holds the largest share of the digital marketing software market, helped by advanced technology infrastructure and heavy digital advertising spending. The CMI report points to North America digital marketing software market share leadership resting on those two strengths. The United States leads global innovation in the field, and 2025 data shows over 75% of American enterprises adopted AI-powered marketing platforms, according to the CMI report. Digital advertising expenditures in the USA surpass USD 120 billion in 2026, the CMI report adds, which supports market expansion. Buyers elsewhere watch American adoption closely because it shows what the tools can do at scale. Asia Pacific is the fastest-growing region, fueled by rapid digitization, supportive policies and a growing small and midsize business sector, the CMI report notes. A Gartner survey found that 78% of CMOs report feeling unprepared for the future of marketing technology, cmonewsdesk.com reported in July 2026, which suggests spending may lag behind the sense of need."
