- Q4 [drivers; can head trends] What is driving the growth of the digital marketing software market?
- Q6 [technology_impact; can head trends] How is AI changing digital marketing software?
- Q7 [region; can head country_us] Which region leads the digital marketing software market?
- Q8 [players; can head key_players] Who are the top players in the digital marketing software market?

