Purpose (what the reader learns here): North America leads on advanced infrastructure and heavy digital ad spending, the United States drives innovation with wide AI adoption and over USD 120 billion in digital ad spend, and Asia Pacific is the fastest-growing region.
The heading is a question people really search. Answer it directly in the first one or two sentences (about 40 to 60 words), in plain words, then continue with the section.
Facts to use:
- [fs.regions.leader] Leading region: North America (holds the highest market share due to advanced technology infrastructure and significant digital advertising expenditures) (CMI report)
- [fs.regions.fastest] Fastest-growing region: Asia Pacific (fastest-growing region, fueled by rapid digitization, supportive policies, and a growing SME sector) (CMI report)
- [fs.us.0] The USA leads global innovation in digital marketing software, with 2025 data showing over 75% of enterprises adopted AI-powered marketing platforms. (CMI report)
- [fs.us.1] Digital advertising expenditures in the USA surpass USD 120 billion in 2026, supporting market expansion. (CMI report)
Keywords:
  - REQUIRED long-tail search: one sentence of this section must contain every content word of "ai in digital marketing software adoption in usa" (reorder the words freely; only a, the, of, in, for, and may sit between them; never swap a word for a synonym). (rests on fs.us.0).
SHAPE: Plain prose in one or two short paragraphs, or a lead-in sentence followed by "\n- " lines when each line rests on its own listed fact. It covers where the market is strongest and, where facts allow, the United States, in 100 to 200 words in all; fewer than 100 words is a miss, so carry the region picture with the listed facts plus your own plain sentences about what that picture means for buyers.

