Purpose (what the reader learns here): Adobe, Oracle, IBM, ZOHO, Cheetah Digital, SAS Institute, HubSpot, Sprout Social, ActiveCampaign and Salesforce lead the market, and consolidation such as Salesforce's Braze deal shows vendors buying personalization capability.
Facts to use:
- [fs.players] Key players the report names: Adobe, Oracle, IBM, ZOHO, Cheetah Digital, SAS Institute, HubSpot, Sprout Social, ActiveCampaign, Salesforce (CMI report)
- [W18] Salesforce has outlined a fiscal 2030 framework targeting a "Rule of 50," combining revenue growth and margin performance, with sales and marketing efficiency cited as a potential margin lever. (source: MarketBeat · via Yahoo Finance, 2026-08)
